<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "600" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "50"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "escape2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "700" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―I have the same intuition as <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, too...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I escaped the attack by a hair's breadth, and the mace smashed into the asphalt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神鉈振り上げ上半身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
But the strange figure turned toward me at once and raised the nata this time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once again, the strange figure's attack cut through empty air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The nata swung as if to avoid hitting me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that's not it. I dodged it.<PG>
It's not that I've acquired some special reflexes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can tell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can tell what danger is about to befall me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Look, next the mace goes up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
2.2354 seconds later, it comes swinging down at the crown of my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if I move more than 48.5300 centimeters to the right, the strange figure's attack will cut through empty air again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
See? I can tell.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Gh...! Why...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That voice...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. The moment I hear <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> voice, I can also foresee the danger about to befall <STYLE ID="2">this person</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Do you intend to kill me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't see the expression under the Noh mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But as long as I can hear the voice, I can tell <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> future.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\なつみ首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At my feet lay <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, her head gone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did you hate <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> that much?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are you killing me so that I won't deduce the truth?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How naive of you. I no longer have any need for deduction.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, with you doing something like this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would be in tears, wouldn't he?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"H-how do you know that...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A trembling voice. A <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おび">cowering</STYLE> voice. A voice in terror of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE> was afraid of me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Will you kill me? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　But you can't move anymore, can you? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　If you move any more, the drug will leave the muscles all over your body in shreds."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I took out the kitchen knife I had tucked inside my clothes and held it up for <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> to see.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔左.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Will you run? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\五島横顔血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n500\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-400\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n500\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-400\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Will you fight? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Will you turn yourself in?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-450\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n-450\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I gripped the knife and stepped toward <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In step with me, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> backed away like a magnet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It's not that I've gained physical abilities like <STYLE ID="2">hers</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just that I can tell. What threat is coming down on me next.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't even question why I can tell these things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It feels as if I've had this ability since the day I was born.<PG>
And it isn't something momentary and vague like <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, a perfect danger-sense ability, as if every weakness of <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> intuition had been swept away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You intend to run away, taking </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Where are you going?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面土下座逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
On hearing that, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> sank heavily to her knees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's unfortunate is that I can't see <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> past.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only I could see it, I'd know why she did this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> stood up and started running somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. Suicide, to destroy the evidence, is it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Burning yourself to death, to erase the drug in your body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's fine. Do as you please. There's no way for <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE> to be saved anyway.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Whew, what a hassle..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I watched <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> go and wiped off <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> blood, smeared thick across my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now, what should I do from here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I call the police while still holding the knife, they'll suspect me of being the culprit.<PG>
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why, when <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> has died, is no sadness or anger welling up in me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... it must be me who's strange by now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Gaining an ability like this is abnormal in itself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've become so strange that I'm only now noticing it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\なつみ首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, I am no longer afraid.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I think that until now, I was dependent on <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I needed someone who would accept me. I needed a place to belong.<PG>
Thank you for all you have done for me until now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this power I inherited from <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, I will go on living.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nor do I need to depend on <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And above all... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> died for me... 
{PAUSE ""}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "600" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
and I am as happy as I could be.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ある冬の寒い夜に_2低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Many people died in this incident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Ryoji Kogori</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the outside, I'm a pitiful girl who has lost people close to her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I have to behave accordingly.<PG>
For form's sake, I should probably attend their funerals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the surface, I have to play the same me as always.<PG>
Even if I no longer need to depend on people, there's no way I can live entirely on my own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And though I have precognition, it's limited to danger sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I can't earn money gambling, and <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おおもう">raking in a fortune</STYLE> on stocks or investments is impossible too.<PG>
I've always analyzed myself as a person with a strong sense of justice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever the reason, I don't forgive evil.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is a justice meant to keep the people dear to me from being hurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If someone dear to me gets hurt, I get hurt. In other words, a justice for my own sake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking back now, what a selfish justice it was.<PG>
But now that the person dear to me is gone, I probably won't awaken to that sense of justice again, or be tormented by selfish conflicts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Human beings are creatures who, on gaining something big, lose something big they had until then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An easy example is money.<PG>
When someone who has lived in ordinary financial circumstances suddenly gets a large sum of money, their life falls apart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because they don't know how to use money.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When poor people get money, they buy mansions, buy luxury cars, their lives get flashy―<PG>
Once it comes to that, that's the end of it: keeping up the flashy life costs money, like it or not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Live beyond your means, and the payback comes back to you as a matter of course.<PG>
But what happens to people who know how to use money?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They think about how to grow the fortune they've gotten.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People with luck, who can manage their funds soundly and carefully, can draw in even more money.<PG>
The rich people of the world are people like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why the rich are so few in number.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only people who have luck, soundness, and caution can become truly rich.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's how neatly the world works.<PG>
Once you have money, there's no anxiety.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anxiety is a defensive instinct needed to survive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without anxiety, you can be neither careful nor sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people who succeed are the ones who can manage money while still holding on to anxiety.<PG>
My precognition is the same.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once you can see future dangers, there's no anxiety.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if that makes me lose both soundness and caution...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is something I have to watch out for too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why I have to behave as I always have in front of people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a hassle...<PG>
Still, why did I get an ability like this―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hadn't solved that mystery yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The trigger was being drenched in the blood of <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, who'd had a similar ability.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, did <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> also get this ability by being drenched in someone's blood?<PG>
Either way, it was lucky that <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> were alive― 
{PAUSE ""}
For some reason, I can't bring myself to look up to <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> the way I used to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, I even feel an intense loathing toward <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> were alive, I would probably―<PG>
