<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what's up? You okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? No..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I was lost in a strange fantasy, <STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> spoke to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I must have been grinning at that fantasy just now.<PG>
―Shiyo 800, April 11.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until yesterday, we had been attending the Kogori family's funeral.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And today was <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura's</STYLE> funeral in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was to attend that funeral too.<PG>
Of course, I hadn't told anyone who killed <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and the others.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because saying so would be a hassle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I said a thing like that, my perfectly ordinary life would be gone.<PG>
Still... 
{PAUSE ""}
my eyes itched.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm still not used to it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, what a hassle of a life.
